      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAWAIIAN BLOOM (5) finished second at Dalby in a BM50 as a well-supported favourite after settling rearward, and her prior Toowoomba third had more merit than the margin after she struck interference and was held up. She has already won at around this distance and reunites with a rider who has won on her, so she looks the one to beat. WATER LAD (2) is the main danger on depth of form, coming back from a provincial BM58 after making solid inroads from well back at Sunshine Coast, with an Open fifth at Dalby two runs ago also reading well for this grade. VIZSTAR (8) was close up at Kumbia after being steadied near the 200m and gets weight relief. In the mix. JOHNNY THE KID (1) brings winning form after scoring in a BM52 at Toowoomba, but this is a harder meeting and he carries top weight, making him a strong place hope.",
